e flavors are mixed well together and it's made to perfection. This location has a weird entrance....you can enter through the lobby of the building it's located in or there's an entrance on the poydras side...it's easy to miss the entrance. I love the area towards the back of the cafe because, depending on what time of the day it is, it's usually quiet...perfect to study- especially something like statistics (I speak from experience). They also have lil NOLA-souvenirs if you're a tourist."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0VlGRVZ2z62KXgZCc7b5Kw","photo_id":"_LUq4vP6EQ-NsjProtU0xA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_LUq4vP6EQ-NsjProtU0xA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
